"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"More than 1,200 people have died in flooding at the Nepal-Tibet border. Authorities in Nepal are trying to start rebuilding after the disaster.\",            \"english_title\": \"Flooding at Nepal-Tibet Border\",            \"translated_version\": \"M\u00e1s de 1,200 personas han muerto por inundaciones en la frontera de Nepal y T\u00edbet. Las autoridades en Nepal est\u00e1n tratando de empezar a reconstruir despu\u00e9s del desastre.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Inundaciones en Nepal y T\u00edbet\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A man has lived for nine months with a pig kidney transplant while waiting for a human kidney. This is a record for how long someone has lived with a pig kidney.\",            \"english_title\": \"Pig Kidney Transplant Record\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un hombre ha vivido nueve meses con un trasplante de ri\u00f1\u00f3n de cerdo mientras espera un ri\u00f1\u00f3n humano. Este es un r\u00e9cord de cu\u00e1nto tiempo alguien ha vivido con un ri\u00f1\u00f3n de cerdo.\",            \"translated_title\": \"R\u00e9cord de Ri\u00f1\u00f3n de Cerdo\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Javier Milei has repeated his country's claim on a British overseas territory, saying that the situation is changing in their favor.\",            \"english_title\": \"Territory Claim by Javier Milei\",            \"translated_version\": \"Javier Milei ha repetido el reclamo de su pa\u00eds sobre un territorio brit\u00e1nico, diciendo que la situaci\u00f3n est\u00e1 cambiando a su favor.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Reclamo de Territorio por Javier Milei\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The Iranian Red Crescent Society reported that shrapnel from a missile hit a ceremony and killed four people.\",            \"english_title\": \"Missile Shrapnel Incident\",            \"translated_version\": \"La Sociedad de la Media Luna Roja Iran\u00ed inform\u00f3 que fragmentos de un misil golpearon una ceremonia y mataron a cuatro personas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incidente de Fragmentos de Misil\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"The World Meteorological Organization has warned that a natural weather event could cause problems for global economies.\",            \"english_title\": \"Weather Event Warning\",            \"translated_version\": \"La Organizaci\u00f3n Meteorol\u00f3gica Mundial ha advertido que un evento natural del clima podr\u00eda causar problemas para las econom\u00edas globales.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Advertencia de Evento Clim\u00e1tico\"        }    ]}"